# Documentation

- Update `README.md` in the same PR/commit as code changes when behaviour, APIs, env vars, scripts, or structure change.
- API routes: document path, response type (JSON, iCal, JS, text), and purpose.
- Env vars: list required and optional keys in Quick Start / Configuration.
- Project structure: keep the tree accurate when adding routes, `lib/` modules, or `tools/` scripts.
- Do not document features that do not exist; remove stale endpoints and scripts.
